{
  "name": "CVE Watch",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "focus": "software vulnerability and exploitation. That is its core: disclosed vulnerabilities, exploited-in-the-wild reports, ransomware campaigns, supply-chain compromise, and the regulatory or legal consequences that follow an incident",
