  "severity_medium": "a disclosed vulnerability with public exploit code, or a proposed security rule",
  "severity_low": "hardening advice, research write-ups or background analysis",
  "excluded": "Vendor marketing, product reviews, comparison listicles, certification advertisements, index/database pages and generic how-tos",
